# 统一行尾：源码用 LF（避免 Windows/macOS/Linux 之间产生整文件 diff）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制/资源：不做行尾转换，diff 里也不显示
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary

# 生成物：标记为「不参与语言统计」，避免虚增仓库语言占比
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true
tests/e2e/visual.spec.ts-snapshots/* linguist-generated=true

# 文档与配置的 diff 展示
*.md text
*.sql text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
